1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,223
Here's how the missed-call pilot works, start to finish.

2
00:00:03,673 --> 00:00:10,606
You send a call log export from your phone provider, your website form submissions, and the replies you already made.

3
00:00:11,056 --> 00:00:18,395
You get every unanswered lead, most urgent first, repeat callers grouped, and a draft reply for each, for you to send.

4
00:00:18,845 --> 00:00:23,389
There's no connection to your phone system, and Amber never contacts your customers.

5
00:00:23,839 --> 00:00:28,511
One location, your last 30 days of calls, then two weekly refreshes.

6
00:00:28,761 --> 00:00:30,617
The price and terms are on the page.

7
00:00:31,067 --> 00:00:32,219
The link is below.
